WEBVTT

1
00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.666
Lord Krishna here,

2
00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:22.916
in verses two to five, gives a deep vision

3
00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.583
of the relationship between body, soul,

4
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:27.500
and the Supreme.

5
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.000
He explains that the body is the field,

6
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.708
the place where experiences

7
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.833
of joy and sorrow unfold.

8
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.708
The individual soul, the jiva,

9
00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.166
is the knower of that field.

10
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:41.500
But Lord Krishna also makes clear

11
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.458
that besides this,

12
00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:47.250
there is another knower, the Paramatma, 
the Indwelling Supreme,

13
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.541
who dwells in all bodies

14
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:52.166
and knows everything.

15
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:54.625
After this, Lord Krishna promises to describe.

16
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:57.125
the nature of the body,

17
00:01:57.125 --> 00:01:59.500
its qualities, transformations, origin,

18
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.708
and the knower of the body, briefly.

19
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.416
He also explains that

20
00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:05.708
these principles have been explained in detail,

21
00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:07.583
by the ancient sages, the Vedas,

22
00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:09.916
and the Brahma-sutras.

23
00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:12.833
In this way, He gives a person a vision

24
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.875
of their own nature, the Supreme,

25
00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:16.541
and the material world,

26
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.000
through which true spiritual

27
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.833
knowledge is gained.

28
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:26.958
In verse two, Lord Krishna explains

29
00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:29.375
that the body is called the field,

30
00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:31.250
the place where various

31
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.000
experiences manifest.

32
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.541
Just as a farmer

33
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:36.541
sows seeds in his field

34
00:02:36.541 --> 00:02:39.000
and receives the fruit of his labour,

35
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.083
in the same way the body is the stage

36
00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:43.791
where the results of a person's past actions

37
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:47.250
appear in the form of joy and sorrow.

38
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.333
He says,

39
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:52.208
the kshetrajna, that is, the knower of the field,

40
00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:55.250
is the person's soul, the jiva.

41
00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.791
The jiva experiences life through the senses,

42
00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:02.083
but its awareness is limited only to its own body,

43
00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:05.291
and due to its attachment to
the body, it ordinarily

44
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:08.875
experiences attachment and suffering.

45
00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.541
In verse 13.3, Lord Krishna

46
00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:13.958
again identifies the Paramatma,
the Indwelling Supreme, as

47
00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:16.291
another knower of the field.

48
00:03:16.291 --> 00:03:18.208
Unlike the individual soul,

49
00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.375
the Paramatma dwells in all bodies

50
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:25.291
and of every experience and
action is fully aware.

51
00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:28.208
Where the jiva knows only its own body,

52
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:29.541
the Paramatma

53
00:03:29.541 --> 00:03:33.000
knows all fields simultaneously.

54
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.791
Lord Krishna makes clear

55
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:38.375
that true knowledge means
understanding the distinction

56
00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:42.083
between body, soul, and the Supreme.

57
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:44.875
Understand this with a simple example.

58
00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:46.583
Just as a citizen

59
00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:49.583
knows the details of their own property,

60
00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:50.958
but a king of his kingdom's

61
00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:53.583
all properties is aware,

62
00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:56.791
in the same way the jiva knows only its own body,

63
00:03:56.791 --> 00:04:00.916
while the Paramatma knows all bodies.

64
00:04:00.916 --> 00:04:02.666
Recognising this distinction

65
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:04.291
between soul and Supreme

66
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:05.541
brings a person closer

67
00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:07.250
to true knowledge,

68
00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:11.416
frees them from ignorance and attachment.

69
00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:13.000
In verse 13.4, the knower

70
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.541
and the field's roles

71
00:04:14.541 --> 00:04:16.708
after clarifying, Lord Krishna,

72
00:04:16.708 --> 00:04:17.541
the body and

73
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:18.708
the knower's nature,

74
00:04:18.708 --> 00:04:21.666
promises to explain in brief.

75
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:24.833
He outlines its six key aspects,

76
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:27.416
which He explains in detail further on.

77
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:28.500
Among them is,

78
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.416
first, the composition of the body,

79
00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:35.583
a combination of material elements,
senses, and mind.

80
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.041
Second, the qualities of the body,

81
00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:40.500
such as desires, emotions,

82
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.708
and reactions to the outer world.

83
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:47.166
Third, the transformation of the body, birth,

84
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:50.333
growth, disease, and death.

85
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:54.583
Fourth, the origin of the body,
under the supervision of the Supreme,

86
00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:58.000
the combination of prakriti and the soul.

87
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.833
Fifth, the knower of the body,

88
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.791
the soul and the Paramatma.

89
00:05:03.791 --> 00:05:06.666
Sixth, the powers of the knower.

90
00:05:06.666 --> 00:05:09.625
The jiva experiences and enjoys,

91
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:12.708
while the Paramatma guides

92
00:05:12.708 --> 00:05:16.250
and remains as witness.

93
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.416
Understanding these truths brings
the realisation

94
00:05:19.416 --> 00:05:22.916
that the body is temporary and the true self

95
00:05:22.916 --> 00:05:24.750
is the eternal soul.

96
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.125
This knowledge is the foundation
of spiritual progress.

97
00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:32.750
In verse 13.5, Lord Krishna authenticates
His teaching

98
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.291
by pointing to the sages, Vedic scriptures,

99
00:05:36.291 --> 00:05:39.000
and the Brahma-sutras – also called
the Vedanta-sutras –

100
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.750
as sources where this knowledge
has been established.

101
00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.500
The Vedic scriptures are also called hymns,

102
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.500
and the Brahma-sutras the Vedanta- sutras.

103
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.916
The Brahma-sutras analyse through
logical reasoning

104
00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:54.166
and with their help the supreme reality

105
00:05:54.166 --> 00:05:57.041
of the Lord systematically establish.

106
00:05:57.041 --> 00:05:59.791
Lord Krishna mentions these
authoritative sources

107
00:05:59.791 --> 00:06:02.250
to show that the truth

108
00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.875
He is teaching is not new,

109
00:06:04.875 --> 00:06:07.458
but by the ancient sages and scriptures

110
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:10.458
has been validated and explained.

111
00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:13.041
When this knowledge is rightly understood,

112
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:15.833
it frees a person from material bondage

113
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:19.875
and draws them toward spiritual completeness.

114
00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.625
Do you think

115
00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:31.291
that knowledge means earning degrees,

116
00:06:31.291 --> 00:06:36.833
reading books, or collecting facts?

117
00:06:36.833 --> 00:06:40.500
If your answer is yes,

118
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.500
then I want to tell you

119
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.666
what true knowledge is.

120
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:49.750
It is between your body,

121
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.333
your soul, and Me,

122
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:55.708
the Supreme, knowing the difference.

123
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.750
If you consider yourself only the body,

124
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.416
you will chase pleasures,

125
00:07:02.416 --> 00:07:04.250
fear loss,

126
00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.958
and remain entangled in endless worries.

127
00:07:07.958 --> 00:07:11.458
But the moment you understand

128
00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:14.333
that you are the soul,

129
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:19.416
which this body is only temporarily using,

130
00:07:19.416 --> 00:07:23.416
your entire life changes.

131
00:07:23.416 --> 00:07:28.208
Just as an actor plays different roles on stage

132
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:30.166
but knows from within

133
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:34.375
that he is not the character,
but a performer himself,

134
00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:38.625
in the same way the soul plays the
roles of the body,

135
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:43.083
but is not the body itself.

136
00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:44.958
When this understanding comes,

137
00:07:44.958 --> 00:07:49.166
you stop taking things personally.

138
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:50.500
By success and

139
00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.791
failure you stop being shaken.

140
00:07:54.791 --> 00:07:58.250
And when you come to know

141
00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:02.833
that I am present within you,

142
00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:05.791
guiding you,

143
00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:08.416
and witnessing everything,

144
00:08:08.416 --> 00:08:11.833
then with greater awareness,

145
00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:13.291
responsibility,

146
00:08:13.291 --> 00:08:16.958
and peace you begin to live.

147
00:08:16.958 --> 00:08:19.583
If this knowledge is absent,

148
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:22.541
then you remain in illusion.

149
00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:24.958
Constantly reacting,

150
00:08:24.958 --> 00:08:28.791
constantly restless.

151
00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:31.666
Understand this deeply.

152
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:35.916
True knowledge brings freedom,

153
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:37.541
not ego.

154
00:08:37.541 --> 00:08:41.750
It lifts you above the noise of illusion,

155
00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.041
quietens the restlessness of the mind,

156
00:08:45.041 --> 00:08:50.541
and helps you live a meaningful life.

157
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.458
Tell Me one thing,

158
00:08:57.458 --> 00:09:00.083
do you believe

159
00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:03.083
that in a family, trust and respect

160
00:09:03.083 --> 00:09:05.000
are everything?

161
00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.708
And yet, often misunderstandings, hurt feelings,

162
00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:13.583
or differences of opinion shake this foundation.

163
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:15.875
You begin to see each other

164
00:09:15.875 --> 00:09:21.083
only as roles.

165
00:09:21.083 --> 00:09:23.541
He is my father.

166
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:25.541
She is my daughter.

167
00:09:25.541 --> 00:09:30.000
They should behave in this way.

168
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.458
But think,

169
00:09:32.458 --> 00:09:34.291
what would happen

170
00:09:34.291 --> 00:09:37.666
if you looked deeper.

171
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:41.666
If you remembered

172
00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:45.000
that I, the Supreme,

173
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.000
dwell in the heart of every one of them.

174
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.666
When you see your family not merely

175
00:09:52.666 --> 00:09:56.583
as people who err or act selfishly,

176
00:09:56.583 --> 00:10:00.500
but as souls,

177
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.208
in whose hearts I am present,

178
00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:09.458
then your entire perspective becomes gentle.

179
00:10:09.458 --> 00:10:12.416
You listen without taking sides,

180
00:10:12.416 --> 00:10:15.916
and become more cooperative.

181
00:10:15.916 --> 00:10:20.166
You stop giving harsh reactions,

182
00:10:20.166 --> 00:10:24.125
because you remember this.

183
00:10:24.125 --> 00:10:26.916
I am present in them too.

184
00:10:26.916 --> 00:10:30.416
This vision helps you treat each other

185
00:10:30.416 --> 00:10:38.541
with more patience and dignity,
even in difficult times.

186
00:10:38.541 --> 00:10:40.166
When your relationships

187
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:43.458
are founded on spiritual understanding,

188
00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:46.708
then love deepens,

189
00:10:46.708 --> 00:10:49.333
and it rests not on perfection,

190
00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:52.458
but on the divinity present

191
00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:54.000
within all people,

192
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.333
on an equal faith.

193
00:10:57.333 --> 00:11:01.166
And only then does a home truly

194
00:11:01.166 --> 00:11:03.666
begin to feel like a home.

195
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:06.958
Reflect on this, trust

196
00:11:06.958 --> 00:11:12.041
and respect are the greatest foundation.

197
00:11:12.041 --> 00:11:14.875
And it remains unshakeable

198
00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:20.958
when you recognise My presence in one another.

199
00:11:25.333 --> 00:11:28.083
In the professional world,

200
00:11:28.083 --> 00:11:33.416
self-awareness is often praised.

201
00:11:33.416 --> 00:11:36.958
You take personality tests,

202
00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:38.250
your strengths

203
00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.291
and weaknesses you assess,

204
00:11:41.291 --> 00:11:43.666
and try to improve.

205
00:11:43.666 --> 00:11:46.583
This is good, but

206
00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:49.791
it is only a beginning.

207
00:11:49.791 --> 00:11:54.666
True self-awareness goes much deeper.

208
00:11:54.666 --> 00:11:56.958
It begins

209
00:11:56.958 --> 00:11:59.791
when you understand,

210
00:11:59.791 --> 00:12:02.666
I am not this body

211
00:12:02.666 --> 00:12:06.166
or this role.

212
00:12:06.166 --> 00:12:09.875
I am the soul.

213
00:12:09.875 --> 00:12:12.875
And you are not alone.

214
00:12:12.875 --> 00:12:19.041
I, the Supreme, am within you.

215
00:12:19.041 --> 00:12:21.416
Guiding,

216
00:12:21.416 --> 00:12:25.333
witnessing, and supporting you.

217
00:12:25.333 --> 00:12:29.833
When you know this, then your confidence

218
00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:33.958
no longer depends on your position or status.

219
00:12:33.958 --> 00:12:36.750
Failures do not break you,

220
00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:40.958
and praise does not inflate your ego.

221
00:12:40.958 --> 00:12:42.833
You remain steady,

222
00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:45.166
because your identity does not rest

223
00:12:45.166 --> 00:12:48.291
on what others say,

224
00:12:48.291 --> 00:12:51.791
but is based on this.

225
00:12:51.791 --> 00:12:54.916
Who you truly are.

226
00:12:54.916 --> 00:12:57.625
Out of insecurity, you do not

227
00:12:57.625 --> 00:12:59.541
compete,

228
00:12:59.541 --> 00:13:03.541
but contribute for a purpose.

229
00:13:03.541 --> 00:13:06.333
You do not only to gain a position

230
00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:08.041
climb the ladder,

231
00:13:08.041 --> 00:13:11.541
but also grow inwardly.

232
00:13:11.541 --> 00:13:16.083
The person who is firm within

233
00:13:16.083 --> 00:13:19.791
does not break even on losing a position,

234
00:13:19.791 --> 00:13:24.458
and one who has true knowledge of
their own worth

235
00:13:24.458 --> 00:13:27.708
does not compare themselves with others.

236
00:13:27.708 --> 00:13:31.083
This is the self-awareness

237
00:13:31.083 --> 00:13:36.666
that makes you not only a better
professional personality,

238
00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:40.208
but a better human being too.
